    {"sentence": "It simply states the observed results and makes a suggestion without justification.", "error_type": "unsupported_inference", "explanation": "This conclusion is unwarranted because stating the observed results and noting the discrepancy is itself a form of partial justification (pointing to evidence in the data)."},
